  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Belize Sostenible e Inclusivo</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable and Inclusive Belize</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de la presente operacin es aumentar los ingresos y promover medios de vida sostenibles en los sectores de agricultura y turismo. El objetivo especfico es incrementar la competitividad, la resiliencia frente al clima y la sostenibilidad ambiental de las micro, pequeas y medianas empresas (MIPYME).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of this operation is to improve incomes and promote sustainable livelihoods in the agriculture and tourism sectors. The specific objectives are to improve Micro Small and Medium-sized Enterprises (MSMEs) competitiveness, climate resilience, and environmental sustainability.</narrative>
  </description>
